@format 1
@id relay.execute-durable-plan
@title Execute durable Auto-relay plan
@area 6. Relay and routing
@entry submit
@summary Snapshot a complete Auto-relay graph at submission and materialize later stages without consulting mutable tabs.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.add-work, relay.deliver-output, project.restore-session
@tag relay
@tag persistence
@tag plan

@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier
@alias plan = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LRelayPlan
@alias planstore = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LRelayPlanStore

[submit] User submits work with a relay target <input>
- Group immediate work by cohort and inspect the live route once @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> capture

[capture] Capture reachable stages <process>
- Give every stage a new stable ID and clone its layout, processing, export, automatic, Merge, and Funnel state @ plan.LRelayPlanCreate(...)
- Translate ordinary edges and Funnel targets from temporary tab identities to stable stage identities @ plan.LRelayPlanCreate(...)
> persist

[persist] Save before scheduling <decision>
- Atomically save the plan in the active workspace and put its entry-stage ID on immediate work @ planstore.LRelayPlanSave(...)
? "Plan saved" > wait
? "Plan cannot be saved" > legacy

[wait] Predecessor executes <process>
- Keep future work deferred until a predecessor output exists @ courier.LCourierDispatch(...)
> arrive

[arrive] Resolve saved stage <decision>
- Load the cohort plan by batch ID and resolve the work's stable target @ planstore.LRelayPlanRead(...)
? "Automatic ordinary stage" > materialize
? "Merge stage still has reachable work" > collect
? "Funnel stage" > branch
? "Automatic was disabled at submission" > checkpoint

[materialize] Materialize from snapshot <process>
- Construct a detached workspace from the saved layout and export preset @ courier.LCourierPlanStageArrive(...)
- Queue new work with the same cohort and the saved next-stage ID @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> wait

[collect] Persist Merge inputs <storage>
- Retain cohort inputs until no pending or undelivered work can still reach the Merge stage @ courier.LCourierPlanMergeBlocked(...)
> arrive

[branch] Apply saved Funnel rules <process>
- Match the filename against the snapshotted rules and continue at the saved target stage @ plan.LRelayFunnelTargetRead(...)
> arrive

[checkpoint] Pause plan-owned input <storage>
- Persist the input at the stage and optionally mirror it into the original tab when that view still exists @ courier.LCourierPlanStageArrive(...)
= Later checkbox or tab changes do not implicitly resume or redirect the submitted plan.

[legacy] Compatible fallback <error>
- Retain live-tab routing when the durable plan cannot be constituted or persisted @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
= Work remains schedulable, and the failure is recorded.
